      "mergeID": "622913129d6dc70edf0927c3",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I think this is pretty self explanatory, but having any kind of haptic feedback upon entering a Contact Sender/Receiver would be a very welcome addition. It can sometimes be hard to tell when you're within interaction distance or pressing a button without any kind of haptics. You can add sound on your avatar, but haptics would be really useful, especially as a global setting, and then being able to disable it on a case by case basis on the avatar creator's side as well.",
